<title>USA: Tescorp files for 12 mln shr offering.</title>
<headline>Tescorp files for 12 mln shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tescorp Inc said on Wednesday that it has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 12 million shares.</p>
<p>Selling shareholders are offering two million shares of that total, Tescorp said in a statement.</p>
<p>Proceeds to the company will be used to acquire Latin American cable television systems and for repayment of indebtedness.</p>
<p>Prudential Securities will be lead manager of the offering.</p>
</text>
